   "name": "Harvest Your Energy Festival",
   "status": "ongoing",
   "summary": "The committee plans and conducts the annual Harvest Your Energy Festival to engage the community on sustainability and waste reduction. Early meetings focused on vendor logistics, music lineups, recycling fees, and recognizing net-zero municipal facilities (M01#3, M03#5, M06#5). In subsequent years, the committee refined festival operations by introducing shuttle services, wind turbine tours, and expanding electronics recycling and thin-film plastic collection (M13#3, M15#5, M23#3, M29#5). Planning for the festival remains an annual focus, with volunteer recruitment and logistical coordination continuing into late 2026 (M33#3, M35#1).",
