  {
   "name": "Tree Ordinances and Canopy Protection",
   "status": "ongoing",
   "summary": "The committee regularly reviewed and advised on draft municipal tree ordinances governing public and private tree canopy protections. Initial discussions covered splitting the draft ordinance into separate sections for public trees, private trees, and establishing a tree committee (M02#5, M03#7, M07#7). The committee formally voted to endorse revised ordinance drafts for City Council consideration in early 2024 (M17#4). Deliberations and revisions with city departments and Trees Medford continued through subsequent years (M24#5, M25#5), leading to a favorable vote on the public tree ordinance by the City Council Committee of the Whole in 2026 (M33#4, M34#3).",
